<title>USA: Firstfed America names new CFO.</title>
<headline>Firstfed America names new CFO.</headline>
<dateline>FALL RIVER, Mass. 1997-08-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Firstfed America said Thursday that Edward Hjerpe III has joined the company as senior vice president, treasurer and chief financial officer.</p>
<p>This was a new position, Firstfed said.</p>
<p>He would also hold these posts at the company's First Federal Savings Bank of America unit, it said.</p>
<p>Hjerpe had been CFO of the Federal Home Loan Bank of Boston since 1992, Firstfed said.</p>
<p>((New York newsdesk 212-859-1730))</p>
